 resource library, and rent basic camping equipment.","source_url":"https://www.loyola.edu/department/recreation-wellness/outdoor/basecamp.html","source_title":"Basecamp | Department of Recreation and Wellness","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official page lists fall and spring-semester hours only; it is closed during breaks, exams, and summer.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
